  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Industrial Park Pilots for Sustainable Development of Nickel Related Industries in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen the ESG practices in the Indonesia Industrial Parks of Morowali (IMIP) and Weda Bay (IWIP), which are the largest nickel producers in Indonesia, and have strong presence of global companies from the downstream sectors. It will be focusing on eco-industrial park practices, support for community development, education opportunities and capacity building for adoption of relevant standards.</narrative>
  </description>
